WEBVTT

00:30.733 --> 00:34.283
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:34.303 --> 00:37.683
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:37.953 --> 00:43.923
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.083 --> 00:48.713
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:48.733 --> 00:52.243
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:52.263 --> 00:55.753
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:55.773 --> 00:59.283
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

00:59.303 --> 01:05.363
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:18.623 --> 01:22.903
Si Jin

01:22.923 --> 01:26.863
Episode 9

01:26.863 --> 01:28.813
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

01:28.813 --> 01:29.793
Lady Jiang,

01:29.813 --> 01:32.793
I heard
that there's an event here today.

01:32.813 --> 01:34.483
Though you didn't invite me,

01:34.483 --> 01:36.983
I've prepared a humble gift

01:37.003 --> 01:38.793
out of admiration

01:38.813 --> 01:40.263
to express my sincerity.

01:40.283 --> 01:42.453
May you be blessed

01:42.453 --> 01:43.743
and live long.

01:43.763 --> 01:45.313
Thank you.

01:45.333 --> 01:46.923
This birthday banquet

01:46.923 --> 01:48.613
was just an excuse for me

01:48.613 --> 01:50.563
to gather the family

01:50.563 --> 01:51.993
together.

01:52.013 --> 01:54.813
I never expected you
and Mr. Zhen to come.

01:54.813 --> 01:57.243
What a delightful surprise.

01:59.213 --> 02:00.303
Mr. Zhen,

02:00.323 --> 02:01.973
I have long wanted
to find an opportunity

02:01.973 --> 02:04.243
to properly thank you.

02:04.403 --> 02:07.053
Our family faced many difficulties

02:07.073 --> 02:08.313
some time ago.

02:08.323 --> 02:11.623
It was all thanks
to Capital Security's support.

02:12.093 --> 02:13.143
Lady Jiang,

02:13.163 --> 02:14.583
you are too kind.

02:14.603 --> 02:15.773
Upholding justice

02:15.773 --> 02:16.883
is the duty

02:16.883 --> 02:17.953
of Capital Security.

02:17.973 --> 02:19.573
I was merely

02:19.653 --> 02:20.723
handling cases impartially.

02:20.723 --> 02:22.793
Mr. Zhen has a righteous heart,

02:22.813 --> 02:24.373
which is a blessing

02:24.373 --> 02:25.653
to the people of Ling'an.

02:25.653 --> 02:27.193
Thank you for your praise.

02:27.213 --> 02:29.093
You flatter me.

02:29.093 --> 02:30.813
When I went in just now,

02:30.813 --> 02:32.283
I saw the whole place

02:32.283 --> 02:33.373
bustling with life.

02:33.373 --> 02:34.983
Such a flourishing household

02:35.003 --> 02:36.583
is truly enviable.

02:36.603 --> 02:38.753
At my age, having children

02:38.773 --> 02:41.213
and grandchildren
is the greatest blessing.

02:41.213 --> 02:42.703
Indeed.

02:42.723 --> 02:45.123
All the young ladies here
are well-educated

02:45.143 --> 02:46.513
and graceful.

02:46.533 --> 02:48.573
Especially Miss Si.

02:49.163 --> 02:50.983
What do you mean by that?

02:51.003 --> 02:52.583
A while ago,

02:52.603 --> 02:53.713
such a horrifying incident

02:53.713 --> 02:55.193
occurred

02:55.213 --> 02:57.043
at Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

02:57.133 --> 02:59.473
Yet Miss Si not only survived the danger

02:59.493 --> 03:01.963
but also rescued her elder sister.

03:03.253 --> 03:04.863
Speaking of which,

03:04.883 --> 03:06.673
Ms. Jiang Qian is truly unfortunate

03:06.693 --> 03:08.473
to have been caught up in such a thing.

03:08.493 --> 03:09.853
Mother.

03:16.323 --> 03:18.793
Lady Jiang taught Miss Si so well

03:18.813 --> 03:20.373
that she could be so smart

03:20.373 --> 03:21.693
and brave.

03:21.693 --> 03:22.603
Indeed.

03:22.603 --> 03:24.053
As her aunt,

03:24.053 --> 03:25.933
I am also deeply grateful to Si.

03:25.933 --> 03:27.283
If not for her,

03:27.283 --> 03:28.813
who knows

03:28.813 --> 03:29.843
what kind of suffering

03:29.843 --> 03:32.083
Qian would still be enduring?

03:32.843 --> 03:35.103
Your daughter has returned home.

03:35.123 --> 03:36.533
With her by your side,

03:36.533 --> 03:37.813
you should count yourself lucky.

03:37.813 --> 03:39.073
That's true.

03:39.093 --> 03:40.323
With Qian by my side,

03:40.323 --> 03:42.143
at least she has someone to rely on.

03:42.163 --> 03:43.373
Unlike Si,

03:43.373 --> 03:45.413
who lost her mother at a young age.

03:48.603 --> 03:50.083
Lost her mother?

03:50.193 --> 03:51.093
Yes.

03:51.093 --> 03:53.123
Her mother died the moment she was born.

03:53.123 --> 03:55.003
People say she brings misfortune...

03:56.973 --> 03:58.963
She's a child of ill fate.

03:59.443 --> 04:00.993
Without a mother's guidance,

04:01.013 --> 04:03.553
she has still turned out to be
a fine young lady.

04:04.293 --> 04:05.643
Your family truly breeds

04:05.643 --> 04:07.813
exceptional people.

04:08.693 --> 04:10.203
To think that such a fine young lady

04:10.223 --> 04:11.053
was rejected

04:11.053 --> 04:12.353
by Duke An's family,

04:12.373 --> 04:14.163
they really have no vision.

04:14.323 --> 04:15.183
Lady Jiang,

04:15.203 --> 04:17.523
may I ask if Miss Si has since found

04:17.523 --> 04:19.153
another good match?

04:19.173 --> 04:20.593
Not yet.

04:20.613 --> 04:21.643
After all,

04:21.643 --> 04:23.833
good men are hard to come by.

04:23.853 --> 04:26.373
How many are as outstanding

04:26.373 --> 04:28.083
as Mr. Zhen?

04:28.883 --> 04:30.643
Lady Jiang, you flatter us.

04:31.493 --> 04:32.693
For today's banquet,

04:32.693 --> 04:33.733
Ms. Jiang Qian has prepared

04:33.733 --> 04:35.083
fine jewelry and hairpins

04:35.083 --> 04:36.453
as a gift for Miss Pei.

04:36.473 --> 04:37.523
What do you mean by this?

04:37.523 --> 04:38.733
Miss Pei said the things

04:38.733 --> 04:40.203
from Marquis Changxing's family

04:40.203 --> 04:41.323
are unlucky.

04:41.343 --> 04:42.293
She dares not keep them.

04:42.293 --> 04:43.523
How dare you despise us?

04:43.543 --> 04:44.493
Back when Ms. Jiang Qian

04:44.493 --> 04:45.913
was still the heir's wife,

04:45.933 --> 04:47.273
Miss Pei would rush

04:47.293 --> 04:48.253
to receive the gifts

04:48.253 --> 04:49.893
from the Marquis's family.

04:50.373 --> 04:51.503
And now...

04:51.523 --> 04:52.493
You are right.

04:52.493 --> 04:53.903
Time has changed.

04:53.923 --> 04:56.083
Marquis Changxing's heir
has been sentenced to death,

04:56.083 --> 04:57.123
and Ms. Jiang Qian

04:57.123 --> 04:58.253
is now a cast-off woman

04:58.253 --> 04:59.203
after the divorce.

04:59.203 --> 05:00.063
It's not surprising.

05:00.083 --> 05:01.853
How could Ms. Jiang Qian be so ruthless

05:01.853 --> 05:02.853
as to lead her own sister

05:02.853 --> 05:04.503
into a den of wolves and tigers?

05:04.523 --> 05:05.413
In that case,

05:05.413 --> 05:06.673
we truly must thank Miss Si.

05:06.693 --> 05:07.763
If not for her,

05:07.763 --> 05:10.263
our young lady might have
suffered the same fate.

05:10.813 --> 05:12.033
You wretched maid,

05:12.053 --> 05:13.663
have you lost your mind?

05:13.663 --> 05:15.273
How dare you gossip about your master!

05:15.293 --> 05:16.643
Ms. Xiao, I'm sorry.

05:16.643 --> 05:17.933
I will never do it again.

05:17.933 --> 05:19.123
You listen carefully.

05:19.123 --> 05:21.413
Even if my daughter has divorced,
she is still

05:21.413 --> 05:22.563
the most honorable young lady

05:22.563 --> 05:23.613
in this household.

05:23.613 --> 05:24.963
Ms. Xiao, I'm sorry.

05:24.963 --> 05:27.003
Please forgive me, Ms. Xiao.

05:27.003 --> 05:27.803
Mrs. Li,

05:27.823 --> 05:28.823
lock her in the woodshed

05:28.823 --> 05:30.133
and starve her for three days,

05:30.153 --> 05:31.793
so she learns who rules this household.

05:31.793 --> 05:33.823
- Have mercy!
- Where is Jiang Pei?

05:34.293 --> 05:35.983
I haven't seen her for three days.

05:36.003 --> 05:37.083
She hasn't come to greet me,

05:37.083 --> 05:38.353
disrespecting her lineal mother.

05:38.373 --> 05:39.743
Confine her for half a month

05:39.763 --> 05:41.333
to reflect on her mistakes.

05:43.323 --> 05:44.723
My Lady,

05:45.123 --> 05:47.413
I don't think the Zhen family

05:47.413 --> 05:49.473
is influential in Ling'an.

05:49.493 --> 05:51.373
What do you know?

05:51.493 --> 05:53.123
Noble families

05:53.123 --> 05:55.133
are not all the same.

05:55.643 --> 05:58.053
Some have high status

05:58.053 --> 05:59.273
and hold great influence

05:59.293 --> 06:01.273
in court.

06:01.293 --> 06:04.353
Everyone aspires to join such families.

06:04.373 --> 06:05.853
But our family,

06:05.853 --> 06:07.203
far away from court affairs,

06:07.203 --> 06:09.453
merely receiving stipends on schedule,

06:10.053 --> 06:12.003
is far less prestigious

06:12.003 --> 06:13.523
than an official

06:13.523 --> 06:15.453
who holds real power.

06:16.003 --> 06:17.493
Zhen Heng...

06:18.293 --> 06:19.323
Zhen Heng is

06:19.323 --> 06:22.333
the Vice Prefect of Capital Security.

06:22.523 --> 06:24.623
Not only is he powerful,

06:24.643 --> 06:25.933
but he is also favored

06:25.933 --> 06:28.133
by His Majesty.

06:29.643 --> 06:33.933
His future is limitless.

06:34.373 --> 06:36.153
In that case,

06:36.173 --> 06:38.763
Miss Si is truly fortunate.

06:38.853 --> 06:41.443
Her mother

06:41.443 --> 06:43.413
died shortly

06:43.413 --> 06:44.983
after giving birth to her,

06:45.003 --> 06:47.103
and her father
lost his official position.

06:47.123 --> 06:48.523
Our noble title will be gone

06:48.523 --> 06:51.133
after three generations.

06:51.413 --> 06:52.543
Think about it.

06:52.563 --> 06:53.733
How grand and dignified

06:53.733 --> 06:56.373
my past birthday banquets were.

06:56.373 --> 06:59.693
The banquet now is much worse.

07:03.203 --> 07:04.563
Grandmother,

07:04.763 --> 07:06.393
you called for me?

07:06.413 --> 07:07.273
Si,

07:07.293 --> 07:09.333
come and sit by my side.

07:13.053 --> 07:14.523
Si,

07:15.523 --> 07:17.393
Mr. Zhen and his mother

07:17.413 --> 07:19.673
came today to celebrate my birthday.

07:19.693 --> 07:21.203
As you know,

07:21.253 --> 07:22.323
our household has faced

07:22.323 --> 07:24.623
many misfortunes lately,

07:24.643 --> 07:27.233
and Mr. Zhen helped us.

07:27.253 --> 07:28.543
Today,

07:28.563 --> 07:31.003
you must take good care

07:31.003 --> 07:32.943
of Mrs. Zhen.

07:32.963 --> 07:34.523
Do you understand?

07:35.443 --> 07:37.053
Yes, Grandmother.

07:45.003 --> 07:46.673
This color is too bright

07:46.693 --> 07:49.183
for your hair ornament.

07:49.203 --> 07:50.323
Your hairpin

07:50.323 --> 07:52.373
is too plain.

07:52.373 --> 07:54.573
Let me choose one for you.

07:54.643 --> 07:56.013
This one...

07:58.523 --> 08:00.123
I wore this when I married

08:00.123 --> 08:02.493
your grandfather.

08:03.643 --> 08:04.523
It's festive.

08:04.523 --> 08:06.153
Grandmother, I...

08:06.173 --> 08:07.533
Take it.

08:11.643 --> 08:13.083
Thank you, Grandmother.

08:13.933 --> 08:15.123
Fu,

08:15.143 --> 08:16.003
ask the steward

08:16.003 --> 08:17.843
to buy more fine fabric.

08:18.053 --> 08:19.393
Si,

08:19.413 --> 08:21.993
go pick out a few good ones

08:22.013 --> 08:24.913
and have some new dresses made.

08:24.933 --> 08:26.363
Also,

08:26.563 --> 08:28.053
your jewelry

08:28.053 --> 08:29.813
needs to be remade.

08:29.963 --> 08:30.943
Treasure Shop.

08:30.963 --> 08:32.793
Go to Treasure Shop.

08:32.813 --> 08:34.113
They have beautiful pieces.

08:34.133 --> 08:35.583
Pick out a few more.

08:35.603 --> 08:37.693
Charge it to the household account.

08:39.173 --> 08:40.603
Thank you, Grandmother.

08:42.203 --> 08:43.563
Qian.

08:46.533 --> 08:47.933
Qian.

08:49.173 --> 08:50.533
This child.

08:54.443 --> 08:56.413
She's drinking again.

08:59.013 --> 09:00.373
Qian.

09:01.813 --> 09:04.573
Qian, you must stop drinking.

09:05.323 --> 09:07.653
Mother, you're back.

09:07.653 --> 09:08.873
Look at this.

09:08.893 --> 09:12.603
The Letter of Divorce is real, right?

09:14.363 --> 09:15.873
Cao Xingyu

09:15.893 --> 09:18.113
has nothing to do with me, right?

09:18.133 --> 09:20.123
He'll never hit me again, right?

09:20.653 --> 09:22.083
Qian,

09:22.563 --> 09:23.893
these past few days,

09:23.893 --> 09:26.173
you've read the Letter of Divorce
over and over.

09:26.173 --> 09:27.293
The words are written

09:27.293 --> 09:29.333
in black and white.

09:29.443 --> 09:31.463
You no longer have to live in fear.

09:31.483 --> 09:32.833
That wretched man

09:32.853 --> 09:34.613
will be executed after autumn.

09:36.133 --> 09:37.993
That's wonderful, Mother.

09:38.013 --> 09:39.813
- Give me more wine.
- Stop drinking.

09:39.813 --> 09:41.633
Let me drink more to enjoy myself.

09:41.653 --> 09:44.243
Qian, stop drinking.

09:52.413 --> 09:53.673
Do you want

09:53.693 --> 09:54.603
to waste your life

09:54.603 --> 09:56.823
in wine forever?

09:56.843 --> 09:58.893
Is that beast who beat you every day

09:58.893 --> 10:00.723
worth it?

10:03.133 --> 10:04.653
My life?

10:06.413 --> 10:08.293
I am a divorced woman.

10:08.843 --> 10:10.243
Everyone in this house

10:10.243 --> 10:12.123
looks down on me.

10:12.413 --> 10:14.533
What life do I have?

10:14.563 --> 10:16.363
So what if you are divorced?

10:16.723 --> 10:18.343
Our Empress Jiahui

10:18.363 --> 10:20.183
was also sent back to her family.

10:20.203 --> 10:21.693
Yet she later married the Emperor,

10:21.693 --> 10:23.933
standing above all but one.

10:28.203 --> 10:29.563
Qian,

10:30.203 --> 10:31.543
I know

10:31.563 --> 10:33.273
your body aches

10:33.293 --> 10:34.463
and your heart suffers,

10:34.483 --> 10:35.723
but one failed marriage

10:35.723 --> 10:37.693
does not mean

10:37.723 --> 10:39.603
you should lose your ambition.

10:40.693 --> 10:43.453
If we plan carefully,

10:43.893 --> 10:46.483
the future will bring new opportunities.

10:50.083 --> 10:51.843
One day,

10:52.413 --> 10:55.123
you'll become your grandmother's

10:56.013 --> 10:58.293
proudest granddaughter again.

11:03.723 --> 11:05.083
Mother,

11:06.133 --> 11:07.533
is that true?

11:12.723 --> 11:14.303
I promise you.

11:14.323 --> 11:16.293
Everything will get better.

11:19.323 --> 11:21.363
Come on, get up.

11:23.083 --> 11:25.843
If you listen to me

11:26.533 --> 11:28.843
and stop drowning yourself in alcohol,

11:29.083 --> 11:30.463
you will live

11:30.483 --> 11:31.533
an even better life

11:31.533 --> 11:32.963
than Jiang Si.

11:36.173 --> 11:37.603
Jiang Si?

11:40.053 --> 11:41.413
Mother,

11:42.133 --> 11:44.633
do you bear a grudge against her?

11:44.653 --> 11:46.453
If not for her,

11:47.533 --> 11:49.723
I might never have escaped.

11:50.013 --> 11:51.583
She's been visiting me

11:51.603 --> 11:53.483
these past few days.

11:54.443 --> 11:56.003
She is far kinder

11:56.133 --> 11:59.693
than that wretched
and ungrateful Jiang Pei.

12:02.443 --> 12:03.913
Why am I being confined?

12:03.933 --> 12:05.873
I can't even attend
Grandmother's banquet.

12:05.893 --> 12:08.033
Mother, what should I do?

12:08.053 --> 12:09.323
I was hoping that Mother

12:09.323 --> 12:10.673
could introduce me to Mr. Zhen

12:10.693 --> 12:12.703
at the banquet.

12:12.723 --> 12:14.033
Pei,

12:14.053 --> 12:14.933
Ms. Jiang Qian

12:14.933 --> 12:16.533
kindly gifted you jewelry, hairpins,

12:16.533 --> 12:18.113
silks, and satins.

12:18.133 --> 12:19.413
I told you

12:19.413 --> 12:20.413
to accept them.

12:20.413 --> 12:21.703
You don't have to wear them.

12:21.723 --> 12:23.013
Why return them?

12:23.013 --> 12:24.873
Those things are tainted.

12:24.893 --> 12:26.473
It's kind enough of me

12:26.493 --> 12:28.203
to send them back
instead of burning them.

12:28.203 --> 12:29.443
If you don't change your temper,

12:29.443 --> 12:30.943
you will suffer for it.

12:32.013 --> 12:33.203
At the end of the day,

12:33.203 --> 12:34.673
Ms. Xiao is just your lineal mother.

12:34.693 --> 12:35.933
If you offend Ms. Jiang Qian,

12:35.933 --> 12:38.113
Ms. Xiao won't let you off easily.

12:38.133 --> 12:40.053
Jiang Pei is a fool

12:40.323 --> 12:41.603
who focuses on trivialities

12:41.603 --> 12:43.703
and misses the bigger picture.

12:43.723 --> 12:45.343
Her schemes are written

12:45.363 --> 12:47.053
all over her face

12:47.083 --> 12:49.393
as if she's afraid others
won't notice them.

12:49.603 --> 12:51.793
But Jiang Si is different.

12:51.813 --> 12:53.673
She is deep

12:53.693 --> 12:54.533
and calculating,

12:54.533 --> 12:56.203
hiding behind an innocent facade.

12:56.203 --> 12:58.303
Who would've thought could do that?

12:58.323 --> 13:00.173
She got annulled, filed a lawsuit,

13:00.173 --> 13:01.463
and convinced you to divorce.

13:01.483 --> 13:02.873
Which of these

13:02.893 --> 13:05.243
could Jiang Pei have pulled off?

13:05.693 --> 13:07.583
Qian says she hasn't been sleeping well.

13:07.603 --> 13:09.083
I was thinking of making

13:09.083 --> 13:10.423
a sleeping fragrance for her.

13:10.443 --> 13:11.563
Ms. Xiao and Ms. Jiang Qian

13:11.563 --> 13:12.603
treat you badly,

13:12.603 --> 13:14.033
yet you're still good to her.

13:14.053 --> 13:17.003
Qian is just a pitiful soul
with no control over her fate.

13:17.413 --> 13:19.203
Aman,

13:19.203 --> 13:20.323
one cannot always dwell

13:20.323 --> 13:21.513
on the past,

13:21.533 --> 13:23.583
or they'll be trapped.

13:23.603 --> 13:25.063
How can they move forward then?

13:25.083 --> 13:26.883
Regardless,

13:27.363 --> 13:29.413
she did help me in some way.

13:30.203 --> 13:31.653
Help you?

13:32.203 --> 13:33.173
I think she simply reaped

13:33.173 --> 13:35.223
the benefits.

13:35.243 --> 13:36.793
You're suffering now,

13:36.813 --> 13:39.873
and we're worried about you here,

13:39.893 --> 13:41.243
but their chamber

13:41.243 --> 13:43.413
is filled with laughter and joy.

13:45.293 --> 13:47.053
You don't know this, right?

13:47.773 --> 13:49.423
She's used this chance

13:49.443 --> 13:50.533
to secure a connection

13:50.533 --> 13:52.843
with Zhen Heng from Capital Security.

13:53.603 --> 13:55.173
What?

13:55.443 --> 13:56.993
You are still young

13:57.013 --> 13:59.083
and do not understand these things,

13:59.323 --> 14:00.823
but you must remember

14:00.843 --> 14:03.363
that she and you can't prosper together.

14:03.653 --> 14:05.943
If Jiang Si gains the upper hand,

14:05.963 --> 14:07.843
even I will struggle to deal

14:08.363 --> 14:10.573
with someone scheming like her.

14:12.173 --> 14:13.883
Mother, don't worry.

14:14.773 --> 14:17.123
Zhen Heng should not worry you.

14:18.083 --> 14:19.183
I've heard

14:19.203 --> 14:21.963
he is notoriously ruthless.

14:22.323 --> 14:24.323
He has offended

14:24.323 --> 14:26.423
nearly every noble in Ling'an,

14:26.443 --> 14:28.773
which has dimmed his future.

14:28.933 --> 14:30.793
That's why he remains unmarried

14:30.813 --> 14:32.653
even at 25.

14:33.693 --> 14:35.583
That's only what's on the surface.

14:35.603 --> 14:37.273
I have looked into this.

14:37.293 --> 14:40.173
Zhen Heng has a sterling reputation
among civil officials.

14:40.263 --> 14:43.183
His appointment to Capital Security
was arranged by His Majesty.

14:43.203 --> 14:45.513
His Majesty seems indifferent to him,

14:45.533 --> 14:48.203
but in reality, he is training him.

14:48.203 --> 14:50.113
Zhen is bound for the Secretariat

14:50.133 --> 14:52.053
and may become the Prime Minister.

14:55.363 --> 14:57.693
If Jiang Si becomes

14:57.773 --> 14:59.703
the Prime Minister's wife,

14:59.723 --> 15:01.463
what will

15:01.483 --> 15:03.243
happen to us?

15:06.963 --> 15:10.453
(I must think of a way)

15:11.083 --> 15:13.693
(to stop her from marrying Zhen Heng.)

15:17.693 --> 15:20.183
Jiang Si has set her sights
on Mr. Zhen as well?

15:20.723 --> 15:22.533
I am not your birth mother,

15:22.533 --> 15:25.083
but you still call me Mother.

15:25.133 --> 15:27.413
Qian is unreliable,

15:27.443 --> 15:29.363
so I had hoped to count on you.

15:30.323 --> 15:31.933
What a pity.

15:35.013 --> 15:36.373
Mother,

15:36.723 --> 15:38.883
help me think of a plan.

15:39.693 --> 15:41.133
Mother...

15:41.133 --> 15:42.413
Everything before was my fault.

15:42.413 --> 15:44.063
Punish me however you want,

15:44.083 --> 15:45.173
but please help me.

15:45.173 --> 15:46.173
Please, Mother.

15:46.173 --> 15:48.083
I beg you, Mother.

15:49.243 --> 15:50.773
I have

15:51.363 --> 15:52.843
a plan,

15:53.813 --> 15:55.533
but I don't know

15:55.963 --> 15:57.773
if you dare to use it.

16:07.223 --> 16:10.223
(Longevity)

16:10.223 --> 16:13.743
(Jiang)

16:39.203 --> 16:40.563
Leave me.

16:54.803 --> 16:56.683
Mrs. Zhen, please have a seat.

16:57.203 --> 16:58.423
Mr. Zhen.

16:58.443 --> 16:59.803
Miss Jiang.

17:00.573 --> 17:01.943
Let me introduce you.

17:01.963 --> 17:03.323
This is my mother.

17:03.963 --> 17:06.973
Miss Si, we meet again.

17:07.753 --> 17:08.613
Si,

17:08.613 --> 17:10.733
when did you meet Mrs. Zhen?

17:11.613 --> 17:12.843
My niece

17:12.863 --> 17:13.723
will be here soon.

17:13.723 --> 17:16.493
I want to prepare two gifts for her.

17:18.413 --> 17:19.833
Greetings, Mrs. Zhen.

17:19.853 --> 17:22.883
Mother, you and Miss Jiang...

17:23.893 --> 17:26.123
Fate brought us together.

17:26.653 --> 17:27.853
Such a lively event.

17:27.853 --> 17:29.463
Our family is quite large.

17:31.203 --> 17:32.563
Uncle Anmou.

17:33.723 --> 17:35.023
Who's this?

17:35.043 --> 17:36.803
This is Commandant Yu
from Capital Security,

17:36.803 --> 17:38.213
a dear friend of mine.

17:38.483 --> 17:40.363
Oh, you're Zhan's friend.

17:40.693 --> 17:42.053
Welcome.

17:43.003 --> 17:44.363
Let's go.

17:48.803 --> 17:50.183
Mr. Zhen

17:50.203 --> 17:51.283
always hovers

17:51.283 --> 17:52.913
around my sister.

17:52.933 --> 17:54.243
How inappropriate.

17:54.243 --> 17:55.333
It makes me so mad.

17:55.333 --> 17:56.693
Indeed.

17:57.653 --> 17:59.163
Why are you mad?

18:00.243 --> 18:02.123
I'm mad because of you.

18:02.243 --> 18:03.783
You're such a good friend.

18:05.803 --> 18:07.593
At the birthday banquet,

18:07.613 --> 18:08.523
I would like

18:08.523 --> 18:10.833
to raise a toast

18:10.853 --> 18:12.913
to share this joy with everyone.

18:12.933 --> 18:17.073
May our family
be prosperous and blessed.

18:17.093 --> 18:18.533
Cheers!

18:28.653 --> 18:29.943
- Mother.
- Indeed.

18:29.963 --> 18:30.963
In our family,

18:30.963 --> 18:33.043
Si is skilled in the art of fragrance.

18:33.043 --> 18:35.133
Since today is your birthday,

18:35.133 --> 18:37.893
why not have her offer fragrance
as a blessing?

18:37.893 --> 18:40.123
That'd be great.

18:40.173 --> 18:41.523
With Si here,

18:41.523 --> 18:43.003
we won't need

18:43.003 --> 18:44.483
to invite

18:44.483 --> 18:46.503
feast officials anymore.

18:46.523 --> 18:48.113
Grandmother, on your birthday today,

18:48.133 --> 18:50.153
I present fragrances as my gift.

18:50.173 --> 18:51.673
May the lingering fragrance

18:51.693 --> 18:53.783
bring joy to you

18:53.803 --> 18:55.293
and everyone present.

19:58.693 --> 20:00.833
This drug is called Drunk at 8th Step.

20:00.853 --> 20:02.023
It's colorless and tasteless,

20:02.043 --> 20:04.403
but it can make someone intoxicated.

20:04.613 --> 20:06.373
If Jiang Si gets drunk

20:06.373 --> 20:07.553
in front of everyone,

20:07.573 --> 20:09.943
who knows
what disgraceful things she'll do?

20:09.963 --> 20:11.173
After that, how could she

20:11.173 --> 20:13.013
and Mr. Zhen still be possible?

20:13.133 --> 20:14.023
Pei,

20:14.043 --> 20:17.153
this is
a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

20:17.173 --> 20:19.463
I've tried my best to help you.

20:19.483 --> 20:21.293
You must seize it.

21:09.413 --> 21:12.013
Such an exquisite fragrance.

21:12.333 --> 21:13.483
Girls, children.

21:13.483 --> 21:14.703
Come here.

21:14.723 --> 21:15.573
Come on.

21:15.573 --> 21:18.263
Enjoy the scent.

21:18.283 --> 21:20.803
What a rare and wonderful aroma.

21:20.803 --> 21:22.163
Come on.

21:22.963 --> 21:25.443
Everyone, breathe it in.

21:26.283 --> 21:28.813
My sister's fragrance
is truly delightful.

21:37.413 --> 21:40.443
The sky has changed color.

21:43.523 --> 21:45.113
Alright, children,

21:45.133 --> 21:47.493
go back to your seats now.

21:49.413 --> 21:51.313
What a marvelous scent.

21:51.333 --> 21:53.023
Truly marvelous.

21:53.043 --> 21:54.403
Where is...

21:54.693 --> 21:56.363
Where is Miss Si?

21:57.003 --> 21:58.363
Where is Jiang Si?

21:58.483 --> 22:00.443
Commandant Yu is gone too?

22:00.613 --> 22:01.853
Could it be

22:01.853 --> 22:04.423
that Si eloped with Commandant Yu?

22:04.443 --> 22:07.603
Shut your mouth.

22:07.723 --> 22:10.153
Mrs. Zhen, Mr. Zhen,

22:10.173 --> 22:11.573
please forgive us.

22:11.573 --> 22:12.423
Zhan,

22:12.443 --> 22:14.553
isn't Commandant Yu your friend?

22:14.573 --> 22:15.503
Where is he?

22:15.523 --> 22:16.873
Go find him.

22:16.893 --> 22:18.853
How strange.

22:18.853 --> 22:19.743
Let's go.

22:19.763 --> 22:20.943
I'll help look too.

22:20.963 --> 22:22.113
Xiao.

22:22.133 --> 22:24.043
Go search for them.

22:24.043 --> 22:26.873
Could it be that Miss Si is unwell?

22:26.893 --> 22:28.253
Yes.

22:28.573 --> 22:29.633
Mrs. Li,

22:29.653 --> 22:30.783
search carefully.

22:30.803 --> 22:32.133
Leave no corner unchecked.

22:32.133 --> 22:33.493
Yes.

22:34.693 --> 22:36.003
You two, check that side.

22:36.003 --> 22:36.873
Yes, My Lady.

22:36.893 --> 22:38.043
You two, search this way.

22:38.043 --> 22:39.403
Yes.

22:42.133 --> 22:43.283
Have you seen Miss Si?

22:43.283 --> 22:44.203
No.

22:44.223 --> 22:45.133
Have you seen Miss Si?

22:45.133 --> 22:46.493
No.

22:48.613 --> 22:50.123
Si!

22:51.243 --> 22:52.333
Have you seen my sister?

22:52.333 --> 22:53.713
No, Young Master Zhan.

22:53.733 --> 22:55.173
- Hurry.
- Have you seen my sister?

22:55.173 --> 22:57.313
- No.
- Go and find her.

22:57.333 --> 22:58.423
Si!

22:58.443 --> 22:59.673
My Lady,

22:59.693 --> 23:00.803
we've searched the backyard.

23:00.803 --> 23:01.913
No sign of her.

23:01.933 --> 23:02.833
You two,

23:02.853 --> 23:04.413
keep a close watch on Haitang Chamber.

23:04.413 --> 23:05.943
You two, search thoroughly.

23:05.963 --> 23:07.323
Yes.

23:08.003 --> 23:09.133
Have you found her?

23:09.133 --> 23:11.053
No. Yi, what about you?

23:12.003 --> 23:13.463
Let's check over there.

23:15.523 --> 23:16.933
This is bizarre.

23:16.933 --> 23:19.443
There's no sign of her everywhere.

23:35.653 --> 23:37.013
Let's go.

23:55.373 --> 23:58.253
Honey, don't go.

23:59.613 --> 24:01.603
Honey, don't go.

24:01.633 --> 24:03.113
Miss Jiang, what did you just call me?

24:03.133 --> 24:04.533
Honey.

24:04.803 --> 24:06.633
Didn't you say you missed me?

24:06.653 --> 24:07.943
Sit down.

24:07.963 --> 24:09.283
Miss Jiang, what's wrong with you?

24:09.283 --> 24:10.263
Honey,

24:10.283 --> 24:11.913
didn't you say you missed me?

24:11.933 --> 24:13.183
Come here.

24:13.203 --> 24:14.563
Alright.

24:14.853 --> 24:16.673
Keep your voice down.

24:16.693 --> 24:17.783
I'll sit.

24:17.803 --> 24:19.163
Honey.

24:21.283 --> 24:22.773
Honey.

24:23.413 --> 24:25.603
Why won't you hold me?

24:26.093 --> 24:28.123
I miss you.

24:30.413 --> 24:31.773
Honey,

24:32.893 --> 24:34.703
didn't you promise me

24:34.723 --> 24:36.113
that we'd settle down

24:36.133 --> 24:38.123
in Dazhou together?

24:39.803 --> 24:41.393
Settle down in Dazhou?

24:41.413 --> 24:44.003
Do you like Dazhou?

24:44.003 --> 24:45.733
Of course, I do.

24:45.963 --> 24:47.743
I was born and raised

24:47.763 --> 24:49.393
in Dazhou.

24:49.413 --> 24:51.363
How could I not love it?

24:52.173 --> 24:54.013
But I like

24:54.723 --> 24:57.403
living with you even more.

25:01.803 --> 25:03.043
Miss Jiang, this isn't proper.

25:03.043 --> 25:04.403
Honey.

25:05.613 --> 25:09.183
♪ Looking back,
I recall our first encounter ♪

25:09.203 --> 25:12.723
♪ Feelings remain
but things are complicated ♪

25:12.743 --> 25:15.993
♪ Thoughts replay ♪

25:16.333 --> 25:19.403
♪ I can't make up my mind ♪

25:19.993 --> 25:23.503
♪ Can I still make it
through the long night ♪

25:23.523 --> 25:27.143
♪ I fear that we'll part again ♪

25:27.163 --> 25:30.513
♪ A piercing ache lingers within ♪

25:30.513 --> 25:34.123
♪ Shattering the dreams ♪

25:34.143 --> 25:38.013
♪ How many petals fell, I count ♪

25:38.033 --> 25:41.793
♪ It equals the times I think about you ♪

25:42.443 --> 25:43.803
Honey,

25:46.173 --> 25:47.773
it's all my fault.

25:48.803 --> 25:50.973
Even if we're together,

25:51.853 --> 25:52.933
will it still not

25:52.933 --> 25:54.603
end well?

25:57.043 --> 25:59.773
Will we eventually be separated?

26:01.933 --> 26:04.013
How could this happen?

26:04.613 --> 26:05.973
Honey...

26:06.853 --> 26:09.293
What are you talking about?

26:10.283 --> 26:11.693
I'm so hot.

26:11.803 --> 26:13.403
I'm so hot.

26:14.413 --> 26:15.773
Miss Jiang...

26:16.693 --> 26:17.613
Honey,

26:17.613 --> 26:19.023
don't you miss me?

26:19.043 --> 26:20.503
Honey,

26:20.523 --> 26:22.053
come here.

26:23.853 --> 26:25.213
Honey.

26:38.443 --> 26:39.813
Commandant Yu,

26:40.963 --> 26:42.943
what have you done to me?

26:42.963 --> 26:44.533
I saved you.

26:49.203 --> 26:50.943
Why do I feel so dizzy?

26:50.963 --> 26:51.943
Someone must have

26:51.963 --> 26:53.603
poisoned you.

26:53.963 --> 26:55.443
Poisoned?

26:55.483 --> 26:56.673
Who poisoned me?

26:56.693 --> 26:58.743
You'll have to figure it out yourself.

26:59.443 --> 27:01.443
How did you bring me here?

27:04.653 --> 27:05.413
Did you hold me?

27:05.413 --> 27:07.173
If not, how could I have
brought you here?

27:07.173 --> 27:09.123
In front of everyone?

27:09.893 --> 27:11.333
They did see us.

27:11.333 --> 27:13.043
How will I explain this then?

27:13.043 --> 27:14.373
There's no way I can clarify this.

27:14.373 --> 27:16.313
I also don't know how to explain it.

27:23.853 --> 27:24.973
But I have thought of a way

27:24.973 --> 27:26.673
to solve it once and for all.

27:27.283 --> 27:28.733
What is it?

27:31.283 --> 27:32.643
Marry me.

27:36.933 --> 27:38.293
Si,

27:39.373 --> 27:40.773
I want to marry you.

27:41.523 --> 27:43.253
I want you to be my wife

27:43.763 --> 27:45.683
and be with you forever.

27:48.853 --> 27:50.603
Everyone I care about

27:52.283 --> 27:54.363
has died tragically.

27:56.963 --> 27:58.683
I'm afraid you will too.

27:59.333 --> 28:01.573
Then you must marry me.

28:02.573 --> 28:04.923
Because I am an unlucky man.

28:05.003 --> 28:06.363
From now on,

28:06.573 --> 28:08.683
we can be unlucky together.

28:10.523 --> 28:13.253
If only I could meet you earlier.

28:13.613 --> 28:15.813
If I had appeared earlier,

28:15.963 --> 28:17.203
I could have shielded you

28:17.203 --> 28:18.843
from all the calamities.

28:19.483 --> 28:20.843
From now on,

28:21.093 --> 28:22.813
I want to face

28:23.763 --> 28:25.603
the uncertainties with you.

28:26.803 --> 28:28.163
Do you believe me?

28:30.373 --> 28:31.883
I don't believe in fate,

28:33.653 --> 28:35.163
but I believe in you.

28:54.093 --> 28:55.453
Si,

28:57.133 --> 28:58.493
marry me.

29:04.603 --> 29:05.633
Mother,

29:05.653 --> 29:07.763
we've searched the entire house,

29:07.763 --> 29:09.983
but there's no sign of Si.

29:10.003 --> 29:13.053
Commandant Yu is missing too.

29:13.173 --> 29:15.573
Could it be that Si

29:15.723 --> 29:17.613
and Commandant Yu

29:17.613 --> 29:19.403
really left together?

29:19.693 --> 29:21.073
No way.

29:21.093 --> 29:22.443
If they are together,

29:22.443 --> 29:24.313
what will we do if this gets out?

29:24.333 --> 29:26.203
Si was just rejected

29:26.203 --> 29:27.683
by Duke An's family.

29:27.853 --> 29:29.573
If she's involved

29:29.573 --> 29:30.483
in such a scandal...

29:30.483 --> 29:31.913
Enough!

29:31.933 --> 29:33.423
Your sister still hasn't been found,

29:33.443 --> 29:34.523
yet as her younger sister,

29:34.523 --> 29:36.413
you have the time to mock her?

29:36.413 --> 29:37.893
I'm just worried.

29:37.893 --> 29:39.503
Anything could happen

29:39.523 --> 29:41.283
when we can't find her.

29:41.283 --> 29:42.883
Pei, be quiet.

29:43.723 --> 29:45.183
Don't embarrass yourself

29:45.183 --> 29:46.703
in front of Mrs. Zhen's family.

29:46.723 --> 29:48.083
Sit down.

29:48.723 --> 29:50.083
Lady Jiang,

29:50.613 --> 29:52.263
I think

29:52.283 --> 29:54.493
there's something fishy about it.

29:54.853 --> 29:56.783
If you need assistance
from Capital Security,

29:56.803 --> 29:58.923
please let me know.

29:59.763 --> 30:01.633
This is a family matter.

30:01.653 --> 30:03.393
There's no need to trouble you.

30:03.413 --> 30:05.333
Thank you for your kindness.

30:05.523 --> 30:07.263
The internal affairs of the family

30:07.283 --> 30:08.173
truly need to be

30:08.173 --> 30:10.533
properly managed.

30:26.923 --> 30:30.113
♪ On the way to pick lotus flowers ♪

30:30.133 --> 30:35.273
♪ The moon sets over the river at dawn ♪

30:39.293 --> 30:44.993
♪ Girls are in the center of the water
with green huadian and red sleeves ♪

30:45.393 --> 30:51.523
♪ The lotus seeds
smell like their clothes ♪

30:51.573 --> 30:57.803
♪ The way back is long
when a storm is coming ♪

30:57.823 --> 31:03.823
♪ It will take time on the way back ♪

31:03.983 --> 31:10.653
♪ So girls hurry back and wave goodbye ♪

31:14.613 --> 31:17.923
Miss Si, thanks for your filial piety.

31:18.003 --> 31:20.213
Grandmother, the blue lotus
bears many seeds,

31:20.233 --> 31:22.073
and the seeds will bring you
many blessings.

31:22.093 --> 31:23.653
May our family prosper

31:23.653 --> 31:26.153
with an endless family line.

31:26.173 --> 31:28.043
May you enjoy the blessings

31:28.043 --> 31:29.853
of your descendants

31:29.853 --> 31:33.083
and live long with happiness.

31:36.333 --> 31:37.553
Just now...

31:37.573 --> 31:38.413
Grandmother,

31:38.413 --> 31:39.523
my absence just now

31:39.523 --> 31:41.633
was also part of the performance.

31:41.653 --> 31:45.183
The moonlight lingers
over the lotus pond;

31:45.203 --> 31:48.023
fragrance and lotus seeds are presented.

31:48.043 --> 31:49.573
Good.

31:50.253 --> 31:51.613
Good.

32:05.483 --> 32:08.013
Chief, what just happened?

32:08.423 --> 32:09.663
The fireworks were too sudden.

32:09.663 --> 32:10.813
I didn't have time to react.

32:10.823 --> 32:12.533
No need to watch her anymore.

32:14.613 --> 32:16.593
Chief, didn't you tell me to do that?

32:16.613 --> 32:18.983
Why suddenly stop it?

32:19.003 --> 32:20.393
She has a totem,

32:20.413 --> 32:22.883
and she painted the landscape
of the South.

32:23.483 --> 32:25.683
Why stop the investigation?

32:27.893 --> 32:29.223
I'm tired.

32:29.243 --> 32:30.503
I need to rest.

32:30.523 --> 32:32.373
Chief, just one last question.

32:32.373 --> 32:33.813
One question.

32:35.523 --> 32:37.223
Is Jiang Si the Saintess?

32:37.243 --> 32:38.953
Enough talk. Just follow my order.

32:38.973 --> 32:43.913
♪ It's a long story;
we'll take different paths in this life ♪

32:43.933 --> 32:45.293
This...

32:45.643 --> 32:51.443
♪ The world is changing;
may we find where we belong ♪

32:52.203 --> 32:54.073
What does this mean?

32:54.093 --> 32:55.573
He was fine when we left.

32:55.573 --> 32:57.443
Why is he like this now?

32:57.693 --> 33:00.083
Is Jiang Si the Saintess or not?

33:00.203 --> 33:02.203
Is she the Saintess or not?

33:02.203 --> 33:05.403
Are we still investigating?

33:05.403 --> 33:12.143
♪ Looking back,
everything is difficult to untangle ♪

33:12.413 --> 33:18.513
♪ Forgetting the past,
how many can make it ♪

33:19.183 --> 33:25.743
♪ Looking at the past,
there was dew on the mayfly ♪

33:25.763 --> 33:27.123
Miss.

33:28.573 --> 33:29.933
Miss.

33:31.803 --> 33:33.503
Aman, what's wrong?

33:33.523 --> 33:35.843
The bed's ready; it's time to rest.

33:37.373 --> 33:38.733
Sure.

33:41.583 --> 33:44.343
(Earl Dongping's Mansion, Jiang)

33:52.343 --> 33:55.743
(Haitang Chamber)

34:36.363 --> 34:38.113
(Did she get drugged?)

34:38.133 --> 34:39.613
(How did this happen?)

34:40.403 --> 34:42.403
Pei, you're here.

34:42.923 --> 34:45.003
Why rush to leave after taking a look?

34:45.613 --> 34:46.973
You can't leave.

34:49.493 --> 34:51.153
I just came

34:51.173 --> 34:52.883
to check on you.

34:52.883 --> 34:55.303
- I wonder...
- You wonder if I've recovered

34:55.323 --> 34:56.883
from your drug last night?

34:59.133 --> 35:00.403
What are you saying, Si?

35:00.403 --> 35:01.763
I don't understand.

35:02.613 --> 35:03.973
You don't understand?

35:04.213 --> 35:06.523
Then let me explain it.

35:07.743 --> 35:08.723
Jiang Si, are you crazy?

35:08.723 --> 35:09.973
- I am your sister.
- Sister?

35:09.973 --> 35:11.533
Did you ever think of that

35:11.533 --> 35:13.503
when you poisoned me and set me up?

35:14.093 --> 35:15.453
Be careful.

35:16.803 --> 35:18.163
Miss, look.

35:19.403 --> 35:20.843
As expected.

35:20.913 --> 35:22.473
What kind of drug is this?

35:22.613 --> 35:23.603
I don't know.

35:23.603 --> 35:24.753
It has nothing to do with me.

35:24.753 --> 35:26.013
I don't know.

35:26.493 --> 35:28.043
It's not mine.

35:32.453 --> 35:33.923
When Qian helped Cao Xingyu lead you

35:33.923 --> 35:35.533
into Marquis Changxing's Mansion,

35:35.533 --> 35:37.353
why didn't you have
this kind of courage?

35:37.373 --> 35:38.543
Why didn't you hold scissors

35:38.543 --> 35:39.813
to her neck?

35:40.533 --> 35:42.793
Stop dragging others down with you.

35:42.813 --> 35:44.243
She did it because she was desperate.

35:44.243 --> 35:45.133
She had to do it

35:45.133 --> 35:46.323
to protect herself.

35:46.323 --> 35:47.673
She didn't want to harm anyone.

35:47.693 --> 35:48.613
But you?

35:48.613 --> 35:50.343
Did someone force you to drug me?

35:50.363 --> 35:51.453
You schemed to destroy me

35:51.453 --> 35:53.343
in front of everyone.

35:53.363 --> 35:55.223
Jiang Pei, you are

35:55.243 --> 35:56.963
much more malicious than Qian.

36:03.493 --> 36:04.803
What do you know?

36:04.823 --> 36:06.523
How can you say I'm worse
than Jiang Qian?

36:06.533 --> 36:07.613
If I were a lineal daughter

36:07.613 --> 36:09.333
like you all,

36:09.403 --> 36:10.733
would I have to fight and scheme

36:10.733 --> 36:12.373
for everything?

36:12.533 --> 36:14.103
Jiang Qian has always been

36:14.203 --> 36:16.473
better than me since we were little.

36:16.493 --> 36:18.483
She's never respected me.

36:18.653 --> 36:20.153
Whatever she wanted,

36:20.173 --> 36:21.403
Mother would practically

36:21.403 --> 36:23.173
give it to her.

36:23.363 --> 36:24.433
What about me?

36:24.453 --> 36:26.093
I've been humble,

36:26.283 --> 36:28.963
serving Mother every day,

36:29.053 --> 36:31.613
but I don't even have
a marriage proposal.

36:32.203 --> 36:33.693
You're like them.

36:33.903 --> 36:34.873
You're a high and mighty

36:34.873 --> 36:36.203
lineal daughter of First Branch.

36:36.203 --> 36:37.843
Just like everyone else in this family!

36:37.843 --> 36:39.343
You're the same!

36:39.363 --> 36:40.403
You all look down on me,

36:40.403 --> 36:41.763
whose mother is a concubine.

36:41.763 --> 36:44.113
Yes, I look down on you.

36:44.133 --> 36:45.113
But it has nothing to do

36:45.113 --> 36:46.633
with your background.

36:46.653 --> 36:47.533
It's because

36:47.533 --> 36:49.043
of your vile character.

36:49.173 --> 36:50.203
For so many years,

36:50.203 --> 36:51.553
how many times have you bullied me

36:51.553 --> 36:52.883
and made things hard for me?

36:52.883 --> 36:54.393
Can you even count?

36:54.413 --> 36:56.423
After the incident
at Marquis Changxing's Mansion,

36:56.433 --> 36:57.973
I thought you would change.

36:57.973 --> 36:59.093
But it seems

36:59.093 --> 37:01.293
you've gotten even worse now.

37:01.453 --> 37:03.113
How can you want others to respect you?

37:03.133 --> 37:05.443
Do you think people are blind?

37:07.653 --> 37:09.093
It's Mother.

37:09.363 --> 37:10.633
No.

37:10.653 --> 37:11.953
It's Ms. Xiao.

37:11.973 --> 37:13.813
She gave me the drug.

37:13.843 --> 37:15.403
She told me

37:15.453 --> 37:16.523
that if you made a scene,

37:16.523 --> 37:17.653
Mrs. Zhen would never let you

37:17.653 --> 37:19.263
be her daughter-in-law.

37:19.283 --> 37:21.043
That way, I'd have a chance.

37:22.453 --> 37:23.813
Pei,

37:23.883 --> 37:25.433
you're both vile

37:25.453 --> 37:27.213
and foolish.

37:36.743 --> 37:38.633
(Cixin Hall)
What?

37:38.653 --> 37:40.653
Commandant Yu was gone too?

37:41.283 --> 37:43.303
I don't know anything about that.

37:43.323 --> 37:44.323
Your story

37:44.323 --> 37:46.703
of picking lotus flowers
to offer blessings

37:46.723 --> 37:48.883
might've fooled others,

37:49.173 --> 37:50.093
so last night,

37:50.093 --> 37:52.513
I didn't expose you
in front of everyone.

37:52.533 --> 37:54.513
Don't push it.

37:54.533 --> 37:58.003
Grandmother, I'm sorry.

37:58.763 --> 38:00.593
I did keep it from you.

38:00.613 --> 38:03.173
I had unbearable stomach pain
last night,

38:03.283 --> 38:05.173
so I hurried back to Haitang Chamber

38:05.193 --> 38:07.263
before I could tell anyone.

38:07.283 --> 38:08.333
Nonsense.

38:08.353 --> 38:10.283
Last night, I had people
guard Haitang Chamber,

38:10.283 --> 38:11.883
but they didn't see you there.

38:11.883 --> 38:14.553
Aunt Xiao, what do you mean?

38:14.573 --> 38:15.883
You had someone block the door?

38:15.883 --> 38:17.303
Were you hoping I would come back

38:17.323 --> 38:19.403
or hoping I wouldn't?

38:21.453 --> 38:23.133
Why do you assume

38:23.133 --> 38:24.783
the worst of others' kindness?

38:24.803 --> 38:26.403
I was concerned about you.

38:26.403 --> 38:28.223
You disappeared, and so did Mr. Yu.

38:28.223 --> 38:29.653
I was worried about what he might...

38:29.653 --> 38:30.593
If Mr. Yu really wanted

38:30.593 --> 38:31.573
to harm me,

38:31.573 --> 38:33.783
would he choose such a public place?

38:33.803 --> 38:35.243
Instead of worrying

38:35.243 --> 38:36.733
about that,

38:36.803 --> 38:38.263
you should focus

38:38.283 --> 38:39.963
on managing the household.

38:40.943 --> 38:43.263
What does that have to do
with my managing the household?

38:43.263 --> 38:44.743
I had sudden stomach pain last night,

38:44.743 --> 38:47.063
and I think someone poisoned me.

38:48.623 --> 38:50.183
That's impossible.

38:50.183 --> 38:51.983
Mother, you know me.

38:51.983 --> 38:53.483
I'm always meticulous.

38:53.483 --> 38:54.663
There are rarely any mistakes.

38:54.663 --> 38:57.103
Who would dare poison her under my nose?

38:57.103 --> 38:58.943
That's absolutely impossible.

38:59.343 --> 39:00.783
Didn't Mr. Zhen

39:00.783 --> 39:02.583
also mention it last night?

39:02.583 --> 39:03.963
Do you all remember?

39:03.983 --> 39:05.823
There must be
something fishy about this.

39:05.823 --> 39:07.263
Si is just

39:07.263 --> 39:08.943
following Mr. Zhen's words

39:08.943 --> 39:10.963
and spreading nonsense here.

39:10.983 --> 39:12.243
Aunt Xiao,

39:12.263 --> 39:13.943
when Mr. Zhen said that,

39:13.943 --> 39:15.623
my sister wasn't here.

39:18.863 --> 39:19.983
Xiao,

39:20.003 --> 39:21.263
there must be something fishy...

39:21.263 --> 39:22.263
What's with your family?

39:22.263 --> 39:24.043
What do you mean?

39:24.063 --> 39:26.143
Why are you targeting me?

39:26.143 --> 39:27.583
We were talking about why Si

39:27.583 --> 39:29.663
suddenly disappeared.

39:29.663 --> 39:31.503
Why does this concern me?

39:31.503 --> 39:32.943
Why not report it to the authorities?

39:32.943 --> 39:35.243
Mr. Zhen can investigate this.

39:35.263 --> 39:37.843
It's a family matter.
No need to report it.

39:37.863 --> 39:39.103
Right.

39:39.103 --> 39:41.303
Si is perfectly fine here.

39:41.303 --> 39:42.383
Why report it?

39:42.383 --> 39:43.563
Mother is right.

39:43.583 --> 39:45.923
From now on, our girls

39:45.943 --> 39:47.463
should stay away from generals

39:47.463 --> 39:48.823
like Mr. Yu.

39:49.623 --> 39:51.163
What happened to Qian

39:51.183 --> 39:53.883
is a lesson to us.

39:53.903 --> 39:54.923
Grandmother,

39:54.943 --> 39:56.263
you can't think all generals

39:56.263 --> 39:57.843
are like that.

39:57.863 --> 39:59.603
Does Cao Xingyu's malice

39:59.623 --> 40:00.783
mean that all generals

40:00.783 --> 40:02.243
are bad?

40:02.263 --> 40:04.343
If it weren't for generals
defending the borders,

40:04.363 --> 40:06.103
how could we live peacefully?

40:06.103 --> 40:08.523
Mother, listen to that.

40:08.543 --> 40:09.983
Is this something

40:09.983 --> 40:11.443
a lady should say?

40:11.463 --> 40:14.463
You really have a sharp tongue.

40:15.063 --> 40:17.623
Do you have something going on

40:17.623 --> 40:19.143
with him?

40:19.143 --> 40:20.463
Grandmother, of course not.

40:20.463 --> 40:21.823
No?

40:23.463 --> 40:25.423
Fine, then.

40:25.983 --> 40:27.343
Alright.

40:27.543 --> 40:29.263
We've been talking here for a while.

40:29.263 --> 40:30.643
I'm tired. Let's call it a day.

40:30.663 --> 40:32.503
Mother, let me help you.

40:34.103 --> 40:35.943
- Darling!
- She fainted!

40:35.943 --> 40:36.943
- Hurry!
- Is she okay?

40:36.943 --> 40:38.403
- Get her up.
- Mother!

40:38.423 --> 40:39.783
- Mother!
- Get her up!

40:39.783 --> 40:42.063
- Hurry.
- Get up, Mother.

40:49.343 --> 40:50.303
Hurry. Get up.

40:50.303 --> 40:51.383
Come on, Mother.

40:51.383 --> 40:53.063
She's still laughing.

40:55.063 --> 40:56.103
Why did you hit me?

40:56.103 --> 40:58.943
Master, you're bad.

40:58.963 --> 40:59.803
How long has it been

40:59.803 --> 41:00.863
since you came to my room?

41:00.863 --> 41:01.963
What are you doing?

41:01.983 --> 41:03.263
- Everyone's here.
- Hurry.

41:03.263 --> 41:05.343
- How improper!
- Get her dressed.

41:05.343 --> 41:08.183
Master, don't you just like it
when I hit you?

41:08.783 --> 41:11.783
- Mother!
- Master, take your clothes off.

41:12.263 --> 41:13.443
Master.

41:13.463 --> 41:14.783
Hurry and stop her!

41:14.783 --> 41:16.063
Master, don't run!

41:16.063 --> 41:18.263
Come to my room for fun.

41:18.263 --> 41:19.203
We'll have fun.

41:19.223 --> 41:20.283
This...

41:20.303 --> 41:21.383
This is insane.

41:21.383 --> 41:22.703
How shameless!

41:22.703 --> 41:24.203
How improper!

41:24.223 --> 41:25.583
Anmou, listen.

41:25.583 --> 41:27.203
Without my permission,

41:27.223 --> 41:29.723
don't let her leave here.

41:29.743 --> 41:30.963
Yes.

41:30.983 --> 41:32.383
What's going on?

41:32.383 --> 41:33.543
Why has she gone mad?

41:33.543 --> 41:34.523
Grandmother,

41:34.543 --> 41:36.063
did someone poison her?

41:36.063 --> 41:36.983
Poisoned?

41:36.983 --> 41:38.583
Poisoned...

41:39.223 --> 41:40.463
Didn't your mother

41:40.463 --> 41:42.083
just say it clearly?

41:42.103 --> 41:43.643
No one would be poisoned

41:43.663 --> 41:45.823
in this household.

41:45.823 --> 41:48.203
Right. Aunt Xiao runs a tight ship.

41:48.223 --> 41:50.463
There wouldn't be such a mistake.

41:50.663 --> 41:53.903
Looks like Xiao can't manage

41:54.183 --> 41:56.303
the household anymore.

41:56.543 --> 41:57.883
Everyone,

41:57.903 --> 42:00.123
think carefully about who should manage

42:00.143 --> 42:03.903
this household.

42:06.823 --> 42:07.883
Grandmother,

42:07.903 --> 42:09.563
it only makes sense

42:09.583 --> 42:11.063
for Qian

42:11.063 --> 42:12.703
to take over.

42:16.263 --> 42:18.603
(She's dejected.)

42:18.623 --> 42:19.983
(No.)

42:20.183 --> 42:21.803
(Her mother is a concubine.)

42:21.823 --> 42:23.263
(No.)

42:29.823 --> 42:30.763
Grandmother,

42:30.783 --> 42:33.383
I think Si is the perfect choice.

42:39.623 --> 42:40.763
Mother,

42:40.783 --> 42:43.023
Si is still young...

42:48.263 --> 42:50.223
Then it's settled.

42:52.863 --> 42:57.183
(The End of Episode 9)

42:57.753 --> 42:59.483
♪ From place to place ♪

42:59.483 --> 43:04.423
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:04.793 --> 43:07.173
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:07.173 --> 43:11.403
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:12.113 --> 43:14.513
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:14.533 --> 43:18.193
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:18.213 --> 43:21.633
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:21.783 --> 43:27.303
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:28.123 --> 43:31.803
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:31.803 --> 43:35.883
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:36.123 --> 43:37.863
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:37.883 --> 43:42.583
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:42.583 --> 43:46.153
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:46.173 --> 43:50.403
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:50.423 --> 43:52.203
♪ Time glows ♪

43:52.203 --> 43:56.743
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:56.763 --> 44:01.563
♪ And stars ♪

44:05.793 --> 44:08.323
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:08.343 --> 44:11.963
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:11.983 --> 44:15.413
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:15.433 --> 44:20.053
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:20.053 --> 44:23.743
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:23.763 --> 44:27.853
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:27.963 --> 44:29.783
♪ Time glows ♪

44:29.783 --> 44:34.333
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:34.353 --> 44:38.053
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:38.073 --> 44:42.233
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:42.413 --> 44:44.173
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:44.173 --> 44:48.693
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:48.693 --> 44:52.333
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:52.353 --> 44:58.023
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:59.713 --> 45:01.643
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

45:01.643 --> 45:09.143
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
